  ],
  "objectives": [
    {
      "text": "Rewind is described as a future all-in-one social media app.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The funding goal for Rewind was $7,061.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project was unsuccessful in reaching its funding goal by June 25, 2023.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The funding period for Rewind was from May 26, 2023, to June 25, 2023.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rewind aims to combine features from Snapchat, TikTok, Instagram, and Twitter.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Jonathan Stevanka's initial idea for Rewind was to create an Instagram clone.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The app Rewind aims to combine popular features from various social media platforms into one.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "There is a large percentage of users who are unhappy with Instagram but remain due to a lack of competitors.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Jonathan Stevanka created an Instagram account named rewind.app to gauge interest in the Rewind app.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "As of May 15th, 2023, Rewind had over 3,400 followers on its social media account.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rewind has accounts with over 300,000 followers.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": true,
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "User feedback indicates a desire for an app that allows posting without instant strikes, shadow-bans, or permanent bans.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Users want the ability to discuss difficult topics in real time on the Rewind app.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Users want an app where they can post content without facing instant strikes, shadow-bans, or outright permanent bans.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The app aims to allow users to have real-time conversations about hard topics.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Users who want to support the app will have the chance to do so through the donator tiers.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project is open to investors for funding.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rewind started as a 'pet project' for Jonathan Stevanka.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rewind is a social media app built by Jonathan Stevanka over the course of three years.",
      "dimensions": [
        "team",
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "team",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Jonathan Stevanka describes Rewind as having evolved from a 'pet project' into the start of a social media app.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "There is a time crunch to get the Rewind app released in the next two to three months.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "milestone",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt47__openai",
        "chunk_index": 3,
        "char_start": 4200,
        "char_end": 6000
      }
    }
